": "865151511043206", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035389_865151514376539_175007382094924936_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LlFT2Uhzd0oQ7kNvwHZBam2&_nc_oc=AdqkEiuFg6Lmn1sSSNaIcGwIBnjyHLQSZGKBnmnm8EiyRqd7NyRIHb8Esccl_kqkqW8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR4fR3T0JqceIG6lK3_fL8su8NBWiEz0olVJmFPgGdirQ&oe=6B0DC146"}, {"file_name": "Untitled-4.png", "id": "540251453759930", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974568_540251457093263_596185216737678114_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y29mNfhpjKkQ7kNvwEIis5o&_nc_oc=Adou0ylMo1HBc6YWccr5iMSN30-CUX4UF7Z4e4Ov6iu537z-iT0gMyS7Ereyum6ShrU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTzl79Go9_XJeB9ujqHBPlbSCGS7ItxrBmHTI0cFn6avg&oe=6B0DAB25"}, {"file_name": "CTH-Screenshot-10.png", "id": "210466391035364", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031450_210466394368697_3171406121056240819_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=syMWk0H6W9YQ7kNvwGaVbRg&_nc_oc=AdrlIgUup0d_bMQSOofxywoATghycSkIsctqcKRE3BHxoInqUAk4OtMNHmDjuwkWD04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQShhfUzDH5Vvbn5b4-YrQ7R6_3jJGpVNPTcroc1fvR9mQ&oe=6B0DC945"}, {"file_name": "Captain ToonHead Screenshot.png", "id": "426672885500768", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_426672888834101_6085981131912280130_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NtRm1brBJw4Q7kNvwHSWGyd&_nc_oc=AdrxZO4hGlmKf0bkNo9Y3zazral04RH61chD1NgOfabp6L4VM84T3Up7N-Utvq9xowM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRZ_TW6lGPXgQpemdKyd4Xt2Jz5hwFs_-iZ_gxLny_Qhw&oe=6B0DA364"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Oculus-Thumbnail.png", "id": "760441625080166", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974883_760441628413499_3472724892994893008_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2KQNn6CQWN0Q7kNvwFHKkMP&_nc_oc=Adq6AFCay11VBjy6JUDrc1-9b46SEaKAY44S5NJfXAtehCoKo9Jg_VNcFjW_54Mr83k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRl5QuCF-ZV54bi-yim7PTM9fSSL9KxpzW2mCPi0GPBEA&oe=6B0DCCF3"}, "display_name": "Captain ToonHead vs The Punks from Outer Space", "keywords": ["towerdefense", "rts", "narrative", "cartoon", "humor"], "long_description": "\"\u2018Captain Toonhead Might Be The Most Over-The-Top VR Game Ever\"\n- VRScout\n\n\"One of the best tower defense games I have played in VR.\"\n- VRGameFaqs\n\n*An ACTION TOWER DEFENSE*\nYou'll move all over the map, hammering away to upgrade towers, throwing over-powered chanclas recklessly and taking control of your towers to unleash streams of heavy-metal powered hot sauce and shoot electric beams from weaponized pizza at your enemies. \n\n*The hero we got stuck with*\nAfter the squad sent by the World Treaty for Freedom (WTF) got fried in the \"burrito incident\", it falls to Elliott Salazar, the cartoon-obsessed space janitor and only survivor, to save Earth. There\u2019s a new captain onboard: Captain ToonHead! \n\n*Balance action and strategy*\nShooting alone will not defeat the waves of Cyber-C.H.I.C.K.E.N.s and Terra-S.H.A.R.K.s. Combine those PIG\u00f1ata tower bombs with your chancla throws in a very strategic way if you want to save the EnerCubes and defeat Nicholas Voorhees' P.U.N.K. army!", "short_description": "Ever wanted to beat a T-Rex up with a chancla, while building powerful towers that shoot pi\u00f1atas, hot sauce and heat-seeking fireworks? Captain ToonHead is the ACTION TOWER DEFENSE of your cartooniest dreams."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://teravisiongames.com/site/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Teravision Games", "support_website_url": nul